<title>TAIWAN: Cathay Life 1996 pre-tax up 10.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Cathay Life 1996 pre-tax up 10.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     243,212 vs 222,587</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			12,921 vs  11,668</p>
<p>    Net profit			    10,417 vs  10,660</p>
<p>NOTE - Cathay Life Insurance Company is Taiwan's largest insurance firm.  </p>
<p>Cathay Life said its board meeting had proposed a 1996 dividend of T$3 per share, comprising T$1.50 per share in cash dividend and T$1.50 per share in stock dividend, or bonus issue, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>All of the proposals need final shareholder approval at a meeting slated for May 7, it said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
